src/admin/output/pterm.rs adapts pterm v0.12.83 OSC 8 escape handling and
gookit/color v1.6.1 ClearCode semantics, for width calculation only. Printed
bytes are unchanged. Original MIT terms are retained in LICENSE-PTERM and
LICENSE-GOOKIT-COLOR.

src/admin/output/runewidth.rs and runewidth/tables.rs adapt go-runewidth
v0.0.24 and clipperhouse/uax29/v2 v2.7.0 as selected by headscale v0.29.5.
Copyright (c) 2016 Yasuhiro Matsumoto
Copyright (c) 2020 Matt Sherman
Original MIT terms are retained in LICENSE-GO-RUNEWIDTH and LICENSE-UAX29.
The port uses the default StrictEmojiNeutral=true condition, the pinned
Unicode 17 grapheme properties/rules and POSIX environment locale detection.
tools/generate-cli-runewidth-tables.py translates the source data into scalar
ranges; it does not run either implementation or provide parity evidence.
No non-POSIX console code-page discovery is implemented.

